title Content Studio Upload and Video Playback
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode plain
typeface clean
textSize medium

// HLS is the intended playback path. The Range fallback is local-development only.
Content Studio Browser [color: blue] {
  Editor [label: "Staff editor\nItsNomatataWorkspace React/Vite SPA"]
  Reviewer [label: "Client or internal reviewer\nSeparate portal/preview authorization"]
}

Ingress and Control Plane [color: purple] {
  Caddy [label: "HTTPS proxy example\nLive host routing not verified"]
  Kode API [label: "Kode Hono API\nAuth, tenant ownership and media control"]
  Upload Role [label: "Optional Kode API upload process\nVPS Compose declares port 3002"]
}

Persistent Stores [color: green] {
  PostgreSQL [label: "PostgreSQL\nUpload sessions, assets, variants and job leases"]
  Redis [label: "Redis\nShort-lived playback grant state"]
  MinIO [label: "Private MinIO origin\nOriginal video and HLS generations"]
}

Processing [color: yellow] {
  Upload Repair [label: "Upload maintenance process\nReconciles recoverable/stalled sessions"]
  Adaptive Worker [label: "Media-platform worker\nClaims leased jobs and runs FFmpeg"]
}

Playback Delivery [color: red] {
  Public Media Entry [label: "Expected HTTPS media hostname\nOperator routing is required; not verified", color: grey]
  Media Auth [label: "Media-auth\nValidates signed URL and Redis grant"]
  Nginx Edge [label: "Nginx media edge\nLoopback-bound in VPS Compose; private cache"]
  Optional CDN [label: "Future geographic CDN\nNot configured; grant check must remain on cache hits", color: grey]
}

System Notes [color: grey] {
  Control Data Plane [label: "Control plane\nAPI handles upload metadata, status and grants"]
  Media Byte Plane [label: "Media byte plane\nEdge streams HLS; API does not carry HLS segments"]
  Release Boundary [label: "Current evidence\nVPS Compose is staging; media activation is not verified\nRepository release review records NO-GO"]
  Routing Caveat [label: "Upload routing caveat\nCaddy example sends binary routes to API port 3000\nVPS Compose also declares upload role on port 3002"]
  Line Legend [label: "Solid lines show repository-defined paths\nDashed lines show DEV-only, optional, or unverified paths"]
}

Editor <> Caddy: HTTPS auth, upload and control requests
Caddy <> Kode API: Sessions, upload parts, asset registration, status and grants
Reviewer <> Caddy: Portal and preview requests
Kode API > Caddy: Status and 300-second HLS grant; renew about 60 seconds early
Caddy > Editor: API responses
Kode API <> PostgreSQL: Create/resume/complete upload session
Kode API <> MinIO: Server-mediated multipart object upload
Caddy -- Upload Role: Optional route; this Caddy example targets API port 3000
Upload Repair <> PostgreSQL: Find and repair stalled sessions
Upload Repair <> MinIO: Check multipart and stored-object state

Kode API > PostgreSQL: Atomically create asset and adaptive_hls job
Adaptive Worker <> PostgreSQL: Claim, heartbeat, retry and finalize job lease
Adaptive Worker <> MinIO: Read original; write immutable HLS renditions

Editor -- Public Media Entry: Signed HLS requests; public route unverified
Public Media Entry -- Nginx Edge: Operator-managed HTTPS reverse proxy
Nginx Edge > Media Auth: Internal authorization request for each media URL
Media Auth <> Redis: Grant scope, expiry and revocation lookup
Nginx Edge <> MinIO: Signed private-origin reads; eligible 200s cached; Range bypasses cache
Nginx Edge > Editor: HLS playlists and media bytes

Editor -- Caddy: DEV ONLY capability request and HTTP Range
Caddy -- Kode API: DEV ONLY authorized Range route
Kode API -- MinIO: DEV ONLY authorized Range stream

Editor -- Optional CDN: Future geographic distribution
Optional CDN -- Public Media Entry: Preserve authorization on every cache hit
